  "actual_behavior": [
    "Public movement to the configured SIP account completes, original native/controller credentials are revoked, and original preparation authority expires before received DTMF. The source record retains the actual moved generation2/call and logical participant, with a distinct configured route owner and no initial/native surrogate.",
    "Under both EdDSA and ES256, a controlled accepted-codec edit under the actual Conversation writer denies the selected PCMU media. Previously admitted packets are drained; actual marked SIP-to-native and native-to-SIP RTP both stop. The same connected call retains named signaling and remains usable.",
    "While media is denied, removing only source dtmf.send refuses actual INFO before source-row admission. Restoring permission does not revive that original INFO retransmission. Fresh input recovers on the same call. One pending reliable receive spans absence/refusal/retransmission/recovery, so cancellation never retires the native reader.",
    "Each signing scene delivers INFO237ms, negotiated RFC4733 PT101/8kHz/1896samples237ms, and a fresh INFO after replay absence. Six actual signed native frames preserve source kind, original receive time, digits5 and duration237; six source-owner HTTP summaries identify the exact actual frame ID and local submission.",
    "INFO and RFC4733 retransmissions do not create another source or output. Fresh input creates a distinct operation/frame. Restoring accepted media recovers independently decoded marked duplex; original dialogs and configured listener cleanup pass.",
    "Six controlled moved-source methods cover revoked retired credentials, logical-owner versus route-account status, immutable kind/parent/source facts, exact original replay/conflict, route ceiling refusal/recovery, independent directions, one original output reservation, known outcome after revocation, queued writer exclusion/no idle readers, successor unknown versus not-started, and snapshot reservation coverage.",
    "All existing initial received-source direction/media, sibling fanout, captured-outcome retirement, private return/no replay, incomplete/fractional input and successor-uncertainty methods pass. All three existing outgoing production methods pass with both source types still distinct."
  ],
